agent-desktop 1.0.2
Source: https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-desktop
Upstream commit: 9eb9b296192fcb70bda25e918cd6dd66abfa3d0d

This distribution includes the upstream Rust workspace and embedded agent skills,
licensed under Apache License 2.0. LICENSE contains the upstream license text.
UPSTREAM.json records the source revision and the original SHA-256 of every
copied file. PATCHES.md records the local changes.

The Windows and X11 cursor renderers use product arrow geometry adapted from
native/cu-helper/Sources/cu-helper/VirtualCursorStyle.swift in claude-code-haha.
The desktop integration supplies the product cursor colors through the existing
style options. These presentation changes do not provide an isolated input
desktop. The upstream interaction policy and Wayland limitations remain in force.

THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES contains the license texts distributed with the locked Rust
dependencies for all workspace platforms. Cargo.lock records their versions.
